PARITY_COVERED=24

(All 19 visible literals resolve from Localizable.xcstrings; key names match the
 web. The status badge text reproduces the web `t('exportsList.status.${status}',
 status)` fallback — the web defines NO per-status keys, so the raw status token
 is the rendered value; the native badge passes the wire token as a
 LocalizedStringKey which, with no catalog entry, renders it verbatim — exact
 web behaviour, no invented strings. 17 keys were added to the catalog
 (route.exports + 16 exportsList.*); bulk.selectAll / bulk.selectRow /
 common.delete already existed. Zero hardcoded user-facing strings.)

